1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:09,673
The Associated Press reports that hundreds of migrant children remain stranded in Spain's Ceuta after a mass crossing from Morocco.

2
00:00:09,623 --> 00:00:16,505
Local shelters are full, and officials say many minors need protection under Spanish law.

3
00:00:16,505 --> 00:00:24,549
The crisis is testing border policy, child welfare systems and European cooperation on migration.

